/// A proposed FileID action. The client runs it only through the existing command it names.
/// requiresConfirmation is true for every kind that changes, moves, renames or deletes files or
/// user identities (moveDuplicatesToTrash, applyFolderLayout, undoLastMove, renameToSuggested,
/// namePerson, mergePeople); clients must show a confirmation card with the counts, examples and
